  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the heart of the Rubbers Roost, Viridian was always a survivor. Even after the plague took its toll, leaving him a patchwork of rot and resilience, he traded his dead-eye stare for DRIP, becoming a feared enforcer for the local flock. Now, armed with his trusty waddle-maker, he keeps the peace... or breaks it, depending on who's paying.",
